    "title": "Schedule",
    "section": "",
    "text": "Part I: Fundamentals\nWeekly sessions of 90 minutes. Before the session is the home checkpoint to reach before we meet: chapters of futurecoder in Part I, readings in Part II. Selected Exercism exercises will be added along the way.",
