    "section": "",
    "text": "Session\nDate\nTopic\nBefore the session\n\n\n\n\n1\nTBA\nWhat is Python?\nNothing: it’s the first session 🎉 Bring a laptop with a web browser.\n\n\n2\nTBA\nEnvironments; variables and strings\nInstall Python (Setup);  futurecoder: The Shell, String Basics, Variables\n\n\n3\nTBA\nLoops and conditions\nfuturecoder: For Loops, If Statements\n\n\n4\nTBA\nLists and string methods\nfuturecoder: Lists (13 short pages)\n\n\n5\nTBA\nFunctions and nested structures\nfuturecoder: A Bit More About Strings, Nested Loops, Functions\n\n\n6\nTBA\nDictionaries and frequency lists\nfuturecoder: Boolean Operators, Dictionaries; optional: Tic Tac Toe Project\n\n\n7\nTBA\nFiles, batch processing, Unicode\nPython for Everybody, Chapter 7: Files",
